# Cursor Rule — Testing

Follow `.ai/08-testing.md`.

- Write a failing test first when fixing a bug.
- Add or update tests for any behavior change.
- Do not delete tests to make a build pass — fix the cause.
- Run the test suite before declaring done.
- Choose the right test level by risk: unit, integration, API, e2e, regression, visual QA, manual.
- Never use real PII or production data in tests.
